/**
  ******************************************************************************
  * @file           : main.c
  * @brief          : STM32F407 + PCA9685 - lateral-pair walk with slight delay
  *
  * Requested gait change from current file:
  *   - Front Left + Back Left move together
  *   - Front Right + Back Right move together
  *   - Right side follows left side with a small delay
  *   - Whole gait is slightly slower than the current build
  *
  * PCA9685 channel map:
  *   Front Right : CH0 hip, CH2 knee, CH1 extension
  *   Front Left  : CH3 hip, CH5 knee, CH4 extension
  *   Back Right  : CH6 hip, CH7 knee
  *   Back Left   : CH14 hip, CH15 knee
  ******************************************************************************
  */
